  "notes": "A compound verb combining {掴|つか}む (to grab) and {取|と}る (to take), emphasizing decisive action.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- チャンスを{掴|つか}み{取|と}る (to seize an opportunity)\n- {勝利|しょうり}を{掴|つか}み{取|と}る (to seize victory)\n- {夢|ゆめ}を{掴|つか}み{取|と}る (to achieve one's dreams)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {掴|つか}む: to grab\n- {獲得|かくとく}する: to acquire\n- {手|て}に{入|い}れる: to obtain",
